  "prefLabel": "Home 105.02 Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Home 105.02 Quorum. A quorum of the board shall consist of not less than 4 members and a majority vote by the members present shall be necessary to pass a motion unless otherwise specified by law. In the absence of the chair, vice chair, or secretary, a quorum of the board shall designate a pro tempore officer for the officer or officers absent.\n\nSource. #9503, eff 7-8-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/home100-600.html"
